WEBVTT

00:05:29.881 --> 00:05:31.087
As early as May,

00:05:31.111 --> 00:05:33.414
when challenge trials
were still being considered

00:05:33.438 --> 00:05:36.087
for their role in the fight
against COVID-19,

00:05:36.111 --> 00:05:38.850
the World Health Organization
cited 1Day Sooner

00:05:38.874 --> 00:05:41.635
as an example of the kind
of public engagement needed

00:05:41.659 --> 00:05:43.237
to run a challenge trial.

00:05:43.261 --> 00:05:44.437
In mid-October,

00:05:44.461 --> 00:05:47.381
the UK government
formally announced their intention

00:05:47.405 --> 00:05:50.944
to conduct a challenge trial
at the beginning of 2021.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:55.217
It is clear that the COVID-19 pandemic
is a global crisis.

00:05:55.614 --> 00:05:58.295
It has inspired
record-shattering innovation,

00:05:58.319 --> 00:06:01.828
and it has highlighted the heroic acts
of many frontline workers,